{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1SA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒母耳記上","commonName":"撒母耳記上","title":"撒母耳記上","order":9,"numberOfChapters":31,"sha256":"afd4c42264886886f4c93c9ded2df28672b888cd7589c48c86c727c240db89d3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":31,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/31.json","totalNumberOfVerses":809},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛在非利士人中間"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大衛心裏說：「必有一日我死在掃羅手裏，不如逃奔非利士地去。掃羅見我不在以色列的境內，就必絕望，不再尋索我；這樣我可以脫離他的手。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["於是大衛起身，和跟隨他的六百人投奔迦特王－瑪俄的兒子亞吉去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大衛和他的兩個妻，就是耶斯列人亞希暖和作過拿八妻的迦密人亞比該，並跟隨他的人，連各人的眷屬，都住在迦特的亞吉那裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["有人告訴掃羅說：「大衛逃到迦特。」掃羅就不再尋索他了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大衛對亞吉說：「我若在你眼前蒙恩，求你在京外的城邑中賜我一個地方居住。僕人何必與王同住京都呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["當日亞吉將洗革拉賜給他，因此洗革拉屬猶大王，直到今日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["大衛在非利士地住了一年零四個月。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大衛和跟隨他的人上去，侵奪基述人、基色人、亞瑪力人之地。這幾族歷來住在那地，從書珥直到埃及。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["大衛擊殺那地的人，無論男女都沒有留下一個，又奪獲牛、羊、駱駝、驢，並衣服，回來見亞吉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["亞吉說：「你們今日侵奪了甚麼地方呢？」大衛說：「侵奪了猶大的南方、耶拉篾的南方、基尼的南方。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["無論男女，大衛沒有留下一個帶到迦特來。他說：「恐怕他們將我們的事告訴人，說大衛住在非利士地的時候常常這樣行。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["亞吉信了大衛，心裏說：「大衛使本族以色列人憎惡他，所以他必永遠作我的僕人了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1SA/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}